---
// Embedding: Service contains a Logger; the table shows which method each call runs.
// Matches the Service/Logger program and its output.
const W = 900;
const H = 300;
const rows = [
  { call: 's.Log("started")', runs: 'Logger.Log', out: '[svc] started', hot: false },
  { call: 's.Describe()', runs: 'Logger.Describe', out: 'I am Logger', hot: true },
  { call: 's.Name()', runs: 'Service.Name', out: 'Service', hot: false },
  { call: 's.Logger.Name()', runs: 'Logger.Name', out: 'Logger', hot: false },
];
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="p04c">
  <div class="p04c-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Service contains an embedded Logger and a Port field. Calls to Log and Describe run Logger's methods, Name runs Service's own method, and Describe prints I am Logger because it calls Logger's Name.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">s</text>
    <text x="40" y="26" class="m">Service</text>
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={122} y={20} size={24} />
    <rect x="20" y="40" width="270" height="228" class="box" />
    <rect x="36" y="56" width="238" height="108" class="cell" />
    <DiagramIcon name="doc" x={250} y={76} size={24} />
    <text x="48" y="80" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Logger (embedded)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Logger (nhúng)</tspan></text>
    <text x="48" y="108" class="m">Prefix</text>
    <text x="130" y="108" class="b">"[svc] "</text>
    <text x="48" y="190" class="m">Port</text>
    <text x="130" y="190" class="b">8080</text>
    <text x="48" y="248" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>s.Prefix and s.Log work directly</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>s.Prefix và s.Log dùng trực tiếp</tspan></text>

    <text x="330" y="26" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>You call</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bạn gọi</tspan></text>
    <text x="540" y="26" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Go runs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Go chạy</tspan></text>
    <text x="720" y="26" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Prints</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>In ra</tspan></text>
    <line x1="320" x2="880" y1="38" y2="38" class="rule" />
    {rows.map((r, i) => {
      const y = 70 + i * 46;
      return (
        <g>
          <text x="330" y={y} class={r.hot ? 'r' : 'b'}>{r.call}</text>
          <path d={`M 480 ${y - 5} L 522 ${y - 5}`} class={r.hot ? 'lnr fm-flow' : 'ln'} />
          <polygon points={`530,${y - 5} 520,${y - 10} 520,${y}`} class={r.hot ? 'arr' : 'ar'} />
          <text x="540" y={y} class={r.hot ? 'r' : 'b'}>{r.runs}</text>
          <path d={`M 676 ${y - 5} L 702 ${y - 5}`} class={r.hot ? 'lnr fm-flow' : 'ln'} />
          <polygon points={`710,${y - 5} 700,${y - 10} 700,${y}`} class={r.hot ? 'arr' : 'ar'} />
          <text x="720" y={y} class={r.hot ? 'r' : 'b'}>{r.out}</text>
          <DiagramIcon name="terminal" x={860} y={y - 5} size={22} />
        </g>
      );
    })}
    <text x="330" y="262" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Describe calls l.Name() with l set to the inner Logger,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Describe gọi l.Name() với l là Logger bên trong,</tspan></text>
    <text x="330" y="282" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>so it runs Logger.Name. Service.Name is never involved.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nên chạy Logger.Name. Service.Name không hề được dùng.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The outer Service wins when both define Name, but code inside Logger only knows about Logger. That is why embedding is not overriding.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Khi cả hai cùng có Name thì Service ngoài thắng, nhưng code bên trong Logger chỉ biết Logger. Vì thế embedding không phải override.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p04c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p04c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p04c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .p04c text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p04c .h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p04c .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p04c .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p04c .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .p04c .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p04c .cell { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p04c .hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p04c .dash { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .p04c .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .p04c .ar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p04c .lnr { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .p04c .arr { fill: var(--red); }
  .p04c .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .p04c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
